Setup               sbbh

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio         0.02                Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0              1.0e-4              Surface Density at r=1
Alpha               1.0e-3              Uniform kinematic viscosity
SigmaSlope          1.0                 Slope for the surface density
FlaringIndex        0.0                 Slope for the aspect-ratio


### Binary parameters 

Bbhomegaratio       12.856406460551014                     Omega_b_in_rotating_frame - Omega_K
Bbhseparation       0.003734503955464305                   Binary separation


### Sinks

GammaSink    4.0
RSink        0.0001400394716
DeltaSink    0.0                     # for torq free: dsink=0  

# Radial range for damping (in period-ratios). Values smaller than one
# prevent damping.

DampingZone         1.15

# Characteristic time for damping, in units of the inverse local
# orbital frequency. Higher values means lower damping

TauDamp             0.3

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig        planets/sbbh.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing  0.007002       Smoothing parameters in disk thickness (ts = 3*deltaR/H)
IndirectTerm        No

ExcludeHill	    yes

### Mesh parameters

Nx                  4096                     Azimuthal number of zones
Ny                  2048                     Radial number of zones

Xmin               -3.14159265358979323844  Lower boundary in azimuth
Xmax                3.14159265358979323844  Upper boundary in azimuth
Ymin                0.4                     Inner boundary radius
Ymax                2.5                     Outer boundary radius

Spacing             N                       Non-uniform spacing from a mesh-density function
XMa                 0.02                     
XMb                 0.05
XMc                 50.27

YMa                 0.02
YMb                 0.05
YMc                 67.85
YMy0                1.0

Frame               F                       Method for moving the frame of reference
OmegaFrame          1.0                  Angular velocity for the frame of reference (If Frame is F).

### Output control parameters

DT              0.01570796326795            Physical time between fine-grain outputs
Ninterm         2                          Number of DTs between scalar fields outputs
Ntot            200                         Total number of DTs (2pi = 1 orbit)

OutputDir       @outputs/2d_sbbh_lambda4_gamma4_free_released